{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"DuckBrain tables — namespace 'tables_df_20261123'","version":"1.1.0","description":"Generated from the declared table registry (namespaces/<ns>/tables/*.table.json). PostgREST-style filters/order/paging on every table. This namespace document also describes the global memory routes; those routes retain their existing namespace query/body behavior."},"paths":{"/api/ns/tables_df_20261123/tables/_transaction":{"post":{"operationId":"run_table_transaction","summary":"Apply an ordered list of table mutations as ONE unit (all-or-nothing)","description":"Every action is validated before anything is written. The envelope takes one durability barrier at commit and appends one change record per action. On failure nothing is applied: the response carries `applied: 0`, `rolledBack: true` and `failedAction`.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["actions"],"properties":{"actions":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"object","required":["op","table"],"properties":{"op":{"type":"string","enum":["insert","update","upsert","delete"]},"table":{"type":"string"},"row":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true},"patch":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true},"pk":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Applied — `applied`, `results[]` and the achieved durability"},"409":{"description":"Refused","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"413":{"description":"Refused","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/ns/tables_df_20261123/tables":{"get":{"operationId":"list_tables","summary":"List the tables DECLARED in this namespace","description":"Registry metadata only (name, format, columns, primary, source) — no rows. Namespace-granted: the grant model has no wildcard table name.","responses":{"200":{"description":"The namespace and its declared tables.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["namespace","tables"],"properties":{"namespace":{"type":"string"},"tables":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TableDeclaration"}}}}}}},"403":{"description":"Refused","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"Refused","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/ns/tables_df_20261123/tables/{table}/declare":{"post":{"operationId":"declare_table","summary":"Create or replace a table declaration","description":"Writes through the SAME core the CLI (`duckbrain tables declare`) and the MCP `tables_declare` tool call. 201 when the declaration is new, 200 when an identical contract already existed or `force` replaced it.","parameters":[{"name":"table","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Table name (must match /^[a-z0-9_-]+$/).","schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-z0-9_-]+$"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TableDeclarationRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Idempotent re-declare, or `force` replacement."},"201":{"description":"Declared (new contract)."},"400":{"description":"Refused","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Refused","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Refused","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/memories":{"get":{"operationId":"listMemories","summary":"List memories","description":"Query memories. Namespace selection remains the existing optional namespace query parameter.","parameters":[{"name":"prefix","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"domain","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["person","event","concept","message","config","raw_note"]}},{"name":"author","in"